[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/752365836","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121#issuecomment-752365836","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121","id":752365836,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc1MjM2NTgzNg==","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-12-30T07:58:55Z","updated_at":"2020-12-30T07:58:55Z","body":"Hi all,\r\n\r\nhere the results of my review:\r\n\r\nLicense Inclusion Principles\r\n- the definitive factors are addressed\r\n- The other factors are not quite addressed. I.e. the license only applies to a given set of tools and data. Per definition the licensor is \"Insecure.Com LLC and its successors and assign\". A substantial use is also not monitored. Nevertheless, nmap may be regarded significant enough to add the license.\r\n\r\nProposed next steps:\r\n- decide on inclusion in SPDX (I vote for yes)\r\n- conditional: contact license steward and request commitment\r\n- conditional: create PR\r\n\r\nRevised attributes (see also #1113):\r\n1. License Name: Nmap Public Source License 0.92 (change: omitted 'Version' as this is redundant; v0.92 may be an option)\r\n2. Short identifier: NPSL-0.92 (change: added version information)\r\n3. License Author or steward: TBD\r\n4. Comments: There does not appear to be a standard license header block, but the nmap source code does have one it uses consistently across files. The license is described as based on the GPL version 2.0 but with additional clarifications. The license does not appear on the OSI list of approved licenses.\r\n5. Standard License Header: <request from license steward>\r\n6. URL: https://nmap.org/npsl/ (change: page contains backgrounds on the license; other links are easy to navigate)\r\nhttps://nmap.org/npsl/npsl-annotated.html (for backgrounds)\r\nhttps://svn.nmap.org/nmap/LICENSE (for the raw license text)\r\n7. OSI Status: Not Submitted","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/752365836/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/757632738","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121#issuecomment-757632738","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121","id":757632738,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc1NzYzMjczOA==","user":{"login":"9ary","id":1155030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTUwMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1155030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/9ary","html_url":"https://github.com/9ary","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/9ary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/9ary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/9ary/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/9ary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/9ary/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/9ary/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/9ary/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/9ary/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/9ary/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-01-11T05:32:11Z","updated_at":"2021-01-11T05:32:11Z","body":"> The Fedora Project has an analysis of the nmap license here: https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing/Nmap\r\n> Of note here is that Fedora considers the license free, though GPL-incompatible.\r\n\r\nJust a note, this is about the old nmap license, here's Fedora's statement on this new one: https://www.mail-archive.com/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/msg02463.html.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/757632738/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/758129267","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121#issuecomment-758129267","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121","id":758129267,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc1ODEyOTI2Nw==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinsl