.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-01-22T16:19:21Z","updated_at":"2021-01-22T16:19:21Z","body":"By now a version 0.93 is available.\r\n\r\nThe diff:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/20038021/105516183-de29c180-5cd5-11eb-9177-31bc00ac4d29.png)\r\n\r\nI propose to add both as NPSL-0.92 and NPLS 0.93.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nKarsten","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/765522756/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/774217286","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121#issuecomment-774217286","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121","id":774217286,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3NDIxNzI4Ng==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovej