cense inclusion guidelines) \r\nmore discussion needed on broader question to be done on mailing list, will leave this marked as \"needs discussion\" in meantime","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/781533049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/820577088","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121#issuecomment-820577088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121","id":820577088,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgyMDU3NzA4OA==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-15T16:48:17Z","updated_at":"2021-04-15T16:48:17Z","body":"Discussed on 2021-04-15 call, not currently inclined to add 0.92 because of changes in text / restrictions as well as their apparent move to 0.93. \r\n\r\nWould be more inclined to add the old NMAP license at https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing/Nmap which appears to still be in use for the version of Nmap that is in Fedora now.\r\n\r\nClosing this issue, but if there is a desire to add the old NMAP license, and/or to submit the 0.93 license for review, those can be submitted as issues for review.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/820577088/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2134963182","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121#issuecomment-2134963182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121","id":2134963182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85_QPPu","user":{"login":"ataraxus","id":1838191,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzgxOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1838191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus","html_url":"https://github.com/ataraxus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-28T11:16:25Z","updated_at":"2024-05-28T11:16:25Z","body":"Sorry for commenting on this old issue, but i wasnt able to find the NPSL or NMAP License in recent releases. After reading this issue i would have assumed it was included? I'm using Dependency Track which includes version 3.22 of this list. \r\n\r\nMaybe you could advise me? @swinslow ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2134963182/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2135489433","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121#issuecomment-2135489433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121","id":2135489433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85_SPuZ","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-28T15:15:34Z","updated_at":"2024-05-28T15:15:34Z","body":"@ataraxus Reading back through the issue comments above, I believe the concerns with adding it were in part around confusion about which particular version of Nmap's license was requested to be added.\r\n\r\nIt appears to me that there were at least three versions mentioned in this thread: (1) the old Nmap license [used in Fedora](https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing/Nmap); (2) NPSL v. 0.92; and (3) NPSL v. 0.93.\r\n\r\nSince then, it looks like Nmap has switched to another new version, (4) [NPSL v. 0.95](https://nmap.org/npsl/npsl-annotated.html) (though I seem to be having problems loading that site at present, Internet Archive link [here](https://web.archive.org/web/20240423022552/https://nmap.org/npsl/npsl-annotated.html)).\r\n\r\nI'd suggest that if there's a desire to add it, it probably makes sense to submit a new issue as a request to add a new license, for the particular version to add. (Presumably either the old version in 1 if Fedora is still using it; and/or v 0.95 in 4 if that's the stable current version.) Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2135489433/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2137189588","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121#issuecomment-2137189588","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1121","id":2137189588,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85_YuzU","user":{"login":"ataraxus","id":1838191,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzgxOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1838191?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus","html_url":"https://github.com/ataraxus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ataraxus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subsc